WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,520
The machine is ready. Thank you, store manager.

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,200
A total of 12.9 yuan

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,520
This human being really has

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,680
It obviously looks like a weak plan

5
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,520
You can’t change even a penny less

6
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,680
I don’t want to fight for change with the store manager

7
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,720
Nowadays, customers are accustomed to cash gifts

8
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,280
Why don't you carry more change?

9
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,360
As long as she can't handle it, I'll kill her right away

10
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,540
I'm afraid that this kind of thing will happen again

11
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,260
I also have to ask my colleagues to change some change.

12
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:27,060
So I changed a lot on the way here.

13
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,900
She pulled out a bunch of human change

14
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:29,980
Who are you fighting with?

15
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,500
Store manager, you don’t think I would use fake money

16
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,700
Steal real money from the store

17
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:35,460
Subtle ghost power surges on the wall

18
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,220
this is real money

19
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,820
Store manager, you don’t think I would use fake money

20
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:40,180
Steal real money from the store

21
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:42,020
But who can make counterfeit coins?

22
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,460
Isn’t that a loss-making business?

23
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,940
Don't worry, it's all real money

24
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,500
Could you please give me the amount?

25
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,890
This money in human hands is human currency.

26
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:50,610
When it reaches my hand, it becomes a ghost coin.

27
00:00:50,610 --> 00:00:51,690
And it’s still real money

28
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,210
No, she is teasing us.

29
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:56,270
Why does the store manager look angry?

30
00:00:56,550 --> 00:00:57,830
So strange

31
00:00:58,390 --> 00:00:59,550
The store manager is out

32
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:01,230
Do you still need to be quiet?

33
00:01:01,390 --> 00:01:02,750
It's always good to be cautious
